  "description": "The Franklin Levering Cary Hall Northwest building was the fourth building built in the Cary Quadrangle. When it was built, this building had rooms for 116 students, all of which are furnished similar to the first three buildings. One more building was constructed to form the Cary Quadrangle in 1939. The entire quadrangle was remodeled during a six year renovation project from 2000 to 2006.",
